pr_body:
Fixes #59809.

This PR adds support for configuring default value of `MaxConnectionsPerServer` on `HttpClientHandler` and `WinHttpClientHandler`. 

Usage:

```cs
public class Program
{
    static void Main(string[] args)
    {
        AppContext.SetData("System.Net.Http.HttpHandlerDefaults.DefaultMaxConnectionsPerServer", 1);
        var handler = new HttpClientHandler();
        System.Console.WriteLine(handler.MaxConnectionsPerServer); // prints 1
    }
}
```

The AppContext.SetData function must be called before the first instance of `HttpClientHandler` is created, later updates will not take effect.
